# BioXP operator credential gate — archived removal patch

This preserves the exact credential-gate removal committed as `2737773` on 2026-07-20.

To restore the former implementation later, from the repository root run:

```bash
git apply -R docs/archive/bioxp-operator-credential-gate-removal-2026-07-20.patch
```

It intentionally restores the original API guard, frontend token inputs/headers,
internal admission checks, environment variables, documentation, and tests.

